{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Visual Schedule Pro 是一款以圖片、逐頁或文字清單呈現每日流程的視覺時間表工具，適閤家長、教師、治療師及支援人員協助兒童與成人掌握現在與下一步。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-187.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>視覺時間表靈活呈現</h2>\n<p>可從內建圖庫或自己的相片建立步驟，貼上清單即自動拆成項目，並套用早晨、放學後或睡前範例。時間表可選圖片格狀、逐頁翻看或大字文字列表；完成步驟會聽到柔和提示音，配合進度條與彩紙慶祝，亦可隱藏控制項。無需帳戶、不設廣告，資料留在裝置，支援離線及 iPhone、iPad。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-171-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-172-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-173-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-174-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-175-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-176-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Visual Schedule Pro</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/visual-schedule-pro/id1612013544?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.038501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:28:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:33.252485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:33.252485+00:00","content_hash":"7239d6fa7f7342a50f3c9552ba2cc26b616ab37bb9c736f40e527273ba0f8de0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}